{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010Game Introduction\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 The protagonist ends an ordinary day and falls asleep\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only to awaken in a strange, unfamiliar prison, not their usual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With memories still hazy and a monster in pursuit, death seems inevitable\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Until four strangers appear before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is then that the protagonist realizes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This place is the world of an RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Welcome to the world of \u300aTime in Wonderland\u300b!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been chosen as the hero who will save Wonderland from the tyrant, the Heart Queen.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010System Overview\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300eRe.dive Wonderland\u300f is an otome game where two parts alternate:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>pixel-art style mystery adventure and minigame</strong>\u00a0segment that the player can control directly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and a visual novel part rich in story and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices may lead you on a journey toward the truth of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or guide you straight into unexpected bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every story is shaped by the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010Demo Information\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the following content: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A portion of the early main story (approximately 1 hour of game play) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Investigation system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choice-based system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a feel for the game\u2019s atmosphere and core mechanics. We hope you look forward to the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666<strong> \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfed </strong>\u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/66b6eb05b37fe205f9c6ac419c5fbedd.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist of the story: <strong>Carol</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Name can be changed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;If this is all just a dream... do I even want to wake up?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfee \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/510a6959f6e4d3345bc16f2ff24c2675.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cheerful mood-maker: <strong>Raven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Relax and enjoy it. We've got your back.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/0406a6f749b398df2f73495637b5eef9.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfef \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/898744eecd5e9eee2d896bcb7a6a98e8.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gentle prince with a warm smile: <strong>Setsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;No matter what you choose, it\u2019s all part of the path to the happiest ending.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/1f09f93088555aff914e37f2b81a3cc6.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udff0 \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/e85b70909d69d57842f0ae0f6b4cf4e8.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unpredictable rebel: <strong>Noah</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;So all it takes is saving you to earn your trust? That\u2019s... surprisingly easy.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859980/extras/7f1d078878e83a1f7ae822258ece774f.avif?t=1752226497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\